        "original_id": "5db7df0d-ca28-5810-aa97-6aa57a5bb837",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralph Tresvant, Chad Smith, Sammy Hagar, Michael Anthony, Joe Satriani\n- Groups: New Edition, Red Hot Chili Peppers, Chickenfoot, Van Halen, Montrose\n- Songs: \"Stone Cold Gentleman\"\n- Albums: Ralph Tresvant's eponymous debut album\n\nFacts:\n- Chad Smith was born on October 25, 1961, and he is an American musician.\n- Ralph Tresvant was born on May 16, 1968, and he is also known as Rizz and Rizzo.\n- Chad Smith joined the Red Hot Chili Peppers in 1988 and is the band's current drummer.\n- Ralph Tresvant is an American contemporary R&B singer best known as the lead singer of New Edition.\n- \"Stone Cold Gentleman\" is a song performed by Ralph Tresvant and was issued as the second single from his eponymous debut album.\n- Chickenfoot consists of vocalist Sammy Hagar, bassist Michael Anthony, guitarist Joe Satriani, and drummer Chad Smith.\n- Sammy Hagar was previously in Van Halen and Montrose, and Michael Anthony was also previously in Van Halen.",
